        <div class="record-item"><div class="ri-tier t2"></div><div><div class="ri-title">Hamas Document on General Principles and Policies (2017)</div><div class="ri-desc">Revised position document. Accepts a Palestinian state along 1967 lines without explicitly recognizing Israel. Does not rescind 1988 charter. Drops some anti-Semitic language while maintaining rejection of Zionism.</div></div></div>
        <div class="record-item"><div class="ri-tier t2"></div><div><div class="ri-title">US Intelligence Community 2024 Annual Threat Assessment</div><div class="ri-desc">States that Iran "did not orchestrate nor had foreknowledge of" the Oct 7 attack. Key document for understanding the Hamas-Iran relationship's limits.</div></div></div>
